      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Room-temperature χMT is 39.56 cm3 K mol−1. Below 18 K χMT increases to 40.73 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, indicating weak ferromagnetic Dy···Dy exchange. Magnetization at 2 K and 5 T is 14.85 Nβ and does not saturate. Zero-field ac susceptibility shows SMM behavior with two intramolecular relaxation processes (slow/fast); Arrhenius fits give Ueff = 92 ± 2 K (τ0 = 1.02 × 10−6 s) and 48 ± 2 K (τ0 = 5.57 × 10−7 s). The slow process tunnels at ~2.3 Hz (τ = 67.2 ms) below ~3 K. Desolvation does not remove the dual relaxation.",
